Dragon Burst (2026-10-27): the Renut on Burst Limit (XDK 2.0.6683).

The device is N&B's layout (the values in brackets in the code) with the BL's own tail; the hooks at the
BL's addresses; the device creation is the hook on the hardware setup 0x820B7230 (Direct3D_CreateDevice is
inlined into the game); the interrupt packet writer 0x820AE868 stands in for InsertCallback; XGRegisterPixelShader
is inlined, so the hooks are on CreatePixelShader 0x820A24E8 and the game's material loader 0x820F9CF8.
Evidence: docs/renut/HOOKMAP_BL.md and AVALIACAO_M1.md.

